---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "여행자를 위한 필수 중국어 회화";
const description = "여행 전에 알아두면 좋은 기본 중국어 표현 — 발음, 사용 상황, 그리고 알아듣기 위한 팁까지.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="ko">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/ko/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        생활 정보로 돌아가기
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🗣️ 중국 생활</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        여행자를 위한 필수 중국어 회화
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">열두 개의 표현이 사람들의 태도를 바꿉니다.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 최종 업데이트: 2026년 6월</span>
        <span>⏱️ 약 4분 분량</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 요약</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        중국 여행에 중국어가 꼭 필요한 것은 아닙니다. 하지만 열두 개 정도의 표현만 익혀도 여행이 훨씬 편해집니다. 현지인들은 노력을 진심으로 좋아하고, 더 나은 서비스와 따뜻한 미소, 심지어 시장에서 더 좋은 가격까지 받을 수 있습니다.
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 목차</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#greetings" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">👋 인사 & 예절</a></li>
        <li><a href="#eating" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍽️ 식당 & 주문</a></li>
        <li><a href="#shopping" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛍️ 쇼핑 & 가격</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 이동</a></li>
        <li><a href="#emergencies" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 긴급 상황</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pronunciation" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎵 발음 팁</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="greetings" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">👋</span> 인사 & 예절
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">영어</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">병음</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">설명</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Hello</td><td class="px-6 py-4">你好</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Nǐ hǎo</td><td class="px-6 py-4">누구에게나, 언제나 사용 가능</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Thank you</td><td class="px-6 py-4">谢谢</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Xiè xiè</td><td class="px-6 py-4">자주 말할수록 좋아요</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Sorry / Excuse me</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duì bù qǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">누군가와 부딪혔을 때</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">It's okay</td><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Méi guān xì</td><td class="px-6 py-4">"미안해"에 대한 응답</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Goodbye</td><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zài jiàn</td><td class="px-6 py-4">기본 작별 인사</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>팁:</strong> 식당, 상점, 택시 등 모든 거래 후에 "감사합니다"라고 말하세요. 일상적인 대화에서 큰 차이를 만듭니다.</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="eating" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍽️</span> 식당 & 주문
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">영어</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">병음</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">설명</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Check, please</td><td class="px-6 py-4">买单</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Mǎi dān</td><td class="px-6 py-4">손을 살짝 흔들며</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Delicious!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">好吃！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Hǎo chī!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">요리사 칭찬할 때</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">No spicy</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不加辣</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Bù jiā là</td><td class="px-6 py-4">쓰촨/후난에서 필수</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Water, please</td><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Qǐng gěi wǒ shuǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">수돗물은 마시지 마세요</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="shopping" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛍️</span> 쇼핑 & 가격
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">영어</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">병음</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">설명</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">How much?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多少钱？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duō shǎo qián?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">보편적인 가격 질문</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Too expensive</td><td class="px-6 py-4">太贵了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Tài guì le</td><td class="px-6 py-4">시장에서만 사용</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Can you lower it?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">便宜一点？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Pián yí yì diǎn?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">시장에서 사용, 상점말고</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'll take it</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我要这个</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ yào zhè ge</td><td class="px-6 py-4">결정했을 때</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚇</span> 이동
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">영어</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">병음</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">설명</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Where is...?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...在哪里？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...zài nǎ lǐ?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">장소 이름을 중국어로 보여주기</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'm going here</td><td class="px-6 py-4">去这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Qù zhè lǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">기사에게 주소 보여주기</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Stop here</td><td class="px-6 py-4">这里停</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zhè lǐ tíng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">택시에서</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">How long?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duō jiǔ?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">이동 또는 대기 시간</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>프로 팁:</strong> 항상 목적지를 중국어 글자로 보여주세요.</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="emergencies" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span> 긴급 상황
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">영어</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">병음</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">설명</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Help!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">救命！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Jiù mìng!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">진짜 긴급상황에만</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Call the police</td><td class="px-6 py-4">报警</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Bào jǐng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">비상연락처: 110</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">I need a doctor</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ xū yào yī shēng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">비상연락처: 120</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'm lost</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我迷路了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ mí lù le</td><td class="px-6 py-4">목적지를 중국어로 보여주기</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="pronunciation" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎵</span> 발음 팁
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">중국어는 <strong>성조</strong>를 사용합니다 — 같은 음절을 다른 높낮이로 말하면 뜻이 달라집니다. 하지만 너무 걱정하지 마세요. 문맥이 대개 의미를 명확히 해주고, 현지인들은 관광객에게 관대합니다.</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">네 가지 성조:</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">성조</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">예시</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">뜻</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">설명</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">1성</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mā (妈)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">엄마</td><td class="px-6 py-4">평평하고 높은 음</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">2성</td><td class="px-6 py-4">má (麻)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">저리다</td><td class="px-6 py-4">올라가는 음</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">3성</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mǎ (马)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">말</td><td class="px-6 py-4">내렸다 올라가는 음</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">4성</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mà (骂)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">꾸짖다</td><td class="px-6 py-4">급격히 떨어지는 음</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>최고의 팁:</strong> 천천히 또박또박 말하세요. 대부분의 중국인은 외국인이 성조에 어려움을 겪는 것에 익숙하며 이해하려고 노력할 것입니다.</p>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 관련 가이드</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/ko/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 중국 여행 생존 키트</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">여행 전 완벽 체크리스트</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/ko/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 중국 여행 필수 앱 10선</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">번역 도구를 포함한 필수 앱</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/ko/life/cultural-taboos/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🏮 중국 문화: 하면 안 되는 것</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">사회적 상황에 자신감을 가지고 대처하기</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">출처</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>언어 참고 — 단일 공식 출처 없음.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>